  "scope": "Platform-facing widget wrapper contracts: platform menu descriptors and the menu-bar controller/binding lifecycle, plus window chrome regions. Neutral wrapper behavior is separated from native execution: unbound or unsupported operations report explicit NoOpUnsupported or build-error results, never silent success. Holding a binding clone keeps its mount lease (and native attachment) alive by design. Router/transaction redesign stays with W4. This ledger covers only this family; it does not claim whole-codebase completeness.",
